<title>POLAND: MOSTOSTAL-G AUG NET RISES TO PLN 0.2 MLN.</title>
<headline>MOSTOSTAL-G AUG NET RISES TO PLN 0.2 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results August</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>AUGUST</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.19 vs   0.15</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.36 vs   0.26</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.56 vs   0.36</p>
<p> Sales		   12.55 vs   6.06</p>
<p>JANUARY-AUGUST</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.83 vs   0.61</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 1.27 vs   1.14</p>
<p> Operating profit     2.75 vs   1.40</p>
<p> Sales		   53.31 vs  34.93</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish construction company is</p>
<p>Mostostal Gdansk SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
